Mechanical Setup

1. Mounting
Mounting holes are M3, with spacing X = 65mm Y = 55mm.

2. Encoder and Magnet Setup

AS5047P encoder requires a 6x2.5mm, diametrically magnetized magnet.
 - https://www.digikey.com/en/products/detail/radial-magnet-inc/9042/469-1070-ND/5640338

Magnet must be mounted to the bottom of the motor's spinning shaft, with an airgap of approximately 2-3mm to the AS5047P chip on the bottom of the board.
Epoxy or adhesive recommended.

3. Heatsinking

It is recommended to mount the PCB onto a metal chassis if operating at higher power, as no onboard heat sinks are found.
